## Syntax [_syntax_8]

A `bucket_correlation` aggregation looks like this in isolation:

```js
{
  "bucket_correlation": {
    "buckets_path": "range_values>_count", <1>
    "function": {
      "count_correlation": { <2>
        "indicator": {
          "expectations": [...],
          "doc_count": 10000
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
