## Example [_example_7]

The following example uses the Kibana sample data logs data set.

```js
GET kibana_sample_data_logs/_search
{
  "aggs": {
    "date":{ <1>
      "date_histogram": {
        "field": "@timestamp",
        "fixed_interval": "1d"
      },
      "aggs": {
        "avg": { <2>
          "avg": {
            "field": "bytes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
